{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16587","headline":"奉使设宴戏掷笼筹 · 朱湾","name":"奉使设宴戏掷笼筹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"今日陪樽俎，良筹复在兹。\n献酬君有礼，赏罚我无私。\n莫怪斜相向，还将正自持。\n一朝权入手，看取令行时。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"朱湾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16587.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16587","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}